<title>JAPAN: Fuso Lexel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuso Lexel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.69		vs	   11.57</p>
<p> Operating   loss 887    million	  vs   loss 780    million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 1.39		vs     loss 1.54</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.40		vs     loss 1.55</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 97.69 yen	  vs   loss 108.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuso Lexel Inc is originally and gas and storage tank piping company and has advanced into housing sale.</p>
